        "statement": "We have $W(0)=0$ and $W(1)=1$. For $z\\in\\mathbb Z$ and $m\\geq0$,\n\\begin{align}\n W(-z)&=W(z),\n &|W(z+1)-W(z)|&\\leq1,\\\\\n W(2m)&=W(m),\n &W(2m+1)&=1+\\min\\{W(m),W(m+1)\\}.\n\\end{align}\nConsequently,\n\\begin{align}\n W(4m)&=W(m),&W(4m+1)&=W(m)+1,\\nonumber\\\\\n W(4m+2)&=1+\\min\\{W(m),W(m+1)\\},\n &W(4m+3)&=W(m+1)+1.\n\\end{align}",
        "status": "preparing",
